  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "i",
      "label": "(I)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "About Snacks"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The snacks are crawling around everywhere."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "All the space station researchers should be fired. I've never seen a lab as messy as this..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Or are these snacks running the lab? This is rude and unacceptable."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ad6f81ede3309b69"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "ii",
      "label": "(II)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "About Skaracabaz"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8e6df237591da4cb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's always go big or go home for these geniuses. The Technology Department will never be able to come up with such a nonsensical research method."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you see this note, I wish you luck. I would turn around right now if I were you."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-92bec826b4983248"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "volumeKey": "iii",
      "label": "(III)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the Intelligentsia Guild, there are often mediocre scholars who are ambitious to make it big. They don't understand that the truth is dangerous, and a fool's imprudent pursuit of knowledge will only bring disaster upon themselves."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I didn't see any clumsy fools when I was walking around just now."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've finally discovered one virtue of this lab."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-24d332f76d1283db"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "volumeKey": "iv",
      "label": "(IV)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "About the greenhouse"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The dust and particles are suffocating... I can't believe there's not even a decontamination unit around here!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-aeeab1aeb37a94ef"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
